<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Surrentum</span></b> , i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a maritime town of
				Campania</i>, now <i>Sorrento</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 8, 544</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				9, § 62</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Surren-tīnus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Surrentum</i>, <i>Surrentine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">montes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					3, 5, 9, § 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 6, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina (of excellent quality),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 6, 8, § 64</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">23, 1, 20,
				§ 35</span></i>; <i><span class="en">23, 1, 21, § 36</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 15, 710</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur. absol.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Surrentina bibis,</span>”
				<i>Surrentine wine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 13, 110, 1</span></i>
			.—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Surrentīni</span></b> , ōrum,
			m., <i>the inhabitants of Surrentum</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv. 22, 61, 12</span></i>.</div>
